# --- The recovery vault is NOT scratch. Do not ignore it. -------------------
# .recovery-vault/ holds the .pyc files that survived the 2026-08-29 wipe.
# They are the only surviving copy of a lot of authored text, and ~100 modules
# import from them at runtime. The *.py[cod] rule above would silently leave
# them untracked, which is how this work would be lost a second time.
!.recovery-vault/
!.recovery-vault/**

# --- Session scratch & Finder duplicates (Decree 0008 / QST-0052) ---
$S/
