* 2.py
* 2.md

# Documenta/Sources holds reference material consulted by hand (books, transcripts).
# It is not repository content (Julio, 2026-09-06, QST-0087).
Documenta/Sources/

# --- Vercel local state (QST-0143) ---
# .vercel/ holds the project link created by `vercel login`/`vercel link`.
# It is per-machine and per-account; the project id belongs in no commit.
.vercel/
